    title: "py.py registers every METHOD under its bare short name in symbol_by_name, so a bare-name call binds a method Python scoping cannot reach (open(...) -> ContentFile.open, list(...) -> ExportersMixin.list; django 56, pretix 28 sites)"  # 0b06
